{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/extras/IMG_8820.gif?t=1751453347\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>This demo drops you straight into the core gameplay loop of <i>O3 - Hollow Descent</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll begin directly in the dungeon: a hostile, ever-shifting environment filled with randomized rooms, combat encounters, and traps. The focus here is on fast-paced, bullet-hell action and procedural exploration. Fight through alien threats, collect loot, and get a taste of the rogue-like systems and moment-to-moment gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This vertical slice is designed to give you a feel for the atmosphere, controls, and intensity of O<i>3: while the full version will expand the story, environments, and progression systems.  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/extras/intro-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1751453347\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/extras/Explore_new.png?t=1751453347\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The depths shift and reshape. Traverse ever-changing corridors, evade deadly traps, and fight to escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/extras/Explore-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1751453347\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/extras/fight_new.png?t=1751453347\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dungeon is relentless. Dash through waves of destruction, unleash devastating weapons, and carve a path through the unknown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/extras/Fight-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751453347\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/extras/discover_new.png?t=1751453347\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the unseen and step beyond the veil. Reveal hidden rooms, open abyssal chests, and exchange remnants for powerful upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/extras/Loot-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751453347\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782050?t=1751453347","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782050?t=1751453347","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/63eb6594706249bfe84618e515041d635dfc5d16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751453347","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/63eb6594706249bfe84618e515041d635dfc5d16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751453347","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/extras/IMG_8820.gif?t=1751453347\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>This demo drops you 