Fight-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751453347\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/extras/discover_new.png?t=1751453347\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the unseen and step beyond the veil. Reveal hidden rooms, open abyssal chests, and exchange remnants for powerful upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/extras/Loot-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751453347\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Ta2 Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2528960","name":"O3 - Hollow Descent "},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782050/577d7eb18fc8bc1cf1575b9f39a7e6e51efa36d9/header.jpg?t=1751453347","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> STEAM DECK</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Core Audio compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Works on Apple Silicon via Rosetta 2</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257153414,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153414/movie480.mp4?t=1751406718","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153414/movie_max.mp4?t=1751406718"},"name":"03